      "worked": "In $mn$ hours, Monica paints $mn\\div m=n$ rooms and Naomi paints $mn\\div n=m$ rooms. Together they paint $m+n$ rooms.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Time for one room}&=mn\\div(m+n)\\\\\\text{Time for one room}&=\\frac{mn}{m+n}\\text{ hours}.\\end{align*}$$",
